                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Reasonable price for the number of puzzle types offered. \nThe game doesn't hold your hand or give much in the way of explanation as to what's expected in each room, which adds to discoverability.\nWell done grasping physics; much better than many experiences currently available in that regard.\nSome non-native English speakers or persons from other cultures may have issues with one of the pictograph puzzles, but should be able to reason it out\n",
